ind":"announcement","title":"White Whisper Soundtrack is now on Steam","summary":"Music is an important part of the atmosphere in White Whisper. That's why we're happy to present the White Whisper Soundtrack, created in collaboration with musician Míra Mudrik.Míra Mudrik is the composer of the tracks featured in White Whisper, and his music helps create the atmosphere of the abandoned U.S.S. Sentinel and the story that awaits you.Add the soundtrack to your wishlist if you'd like to listen to the music from White Whisper and don't want to miss its release.Thank you for your su","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:19:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994800-1842846814453093","game_id":"steam-3994800","kind":"announcement","title":"We have some big news!","summary":"We have some big news for you!WHITE WHISPER HAS BEEN SELECTED AS A NOMINEE FOR THE DEVGAMM AWARDS!We’re incredibly excited to announce that White Whisper has been selected as a nominee for the DevGAMM Awards.For our small indie team, this is a really big moment. We’ve put a lot of passion, time, and energy into White Whisper, so seeing our game among the selected projects means a lot to us.And most importantly - thank you.Thank you to everyone who has added White Whisper to their wishlist, playe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T13:23:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994800-1840944183784175","game_id":"steam-3994800","kind":"announcement","title":"LORE ARCHIVE #02 — U.S.S. Sentinel Arrives in the Tau Ceti System","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T16:25:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784175","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994800-1838407329268959","game_id":"steam-3994800","kind":"announcement","title":"White Whisper Demo Is Now Available","summary":"The distress signal has been received. The airlock is open. Your mission begins now.After months of development, we're excited to present the first playable demo of White Whisper.In the demo, you take on the role of Dr. Elara Wynn, who awakens from cryosleep to investigate a distress call from the research vessel U.S.S. Sentinel. The crew has vanished, and the ship hides secrets waiting to be uncovered.Over the course of approximately 30–60 minutes, you'll explore the abandoned spacecraft, solve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T13:13:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329268959","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994800-1835236783569815","game_id":"steam-3994800","kind":"announcement","title":"White Whisper at IntoGames 2026 in Ostrava","summary":"Hello everyone!We're excited to announce that White Whisper will be showcased at IntoGames 2026 in Ostrava.If you're attending the event, stop by our booth and try the game for yourself. You'll have the opportunity to explore the abandoned research vessel U.S.S. Sentinel, experience the atmosphere of White Whisper, and get a glimpse of what awaits in the full game.We would also love to hear your feedback and talk with you about the game's development, inspirations, and future plans.IntoGames 202","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T10:56:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783569815","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994800-1834602721196877","game_id":"steam-3994800","kind":"announcement","title":"New Atmospheric Trailer Released","summary":"New Atmospheric TrailerWe are excited to share a brand-new trailer for White Whisper, focused on the atmosphere, exploration, and mystery aboard the abandoned research vessel U.S.S. Sentinel. Step into the role of Dr. Elara Wynn as she responds to a distress signal and slowly uncovers the fate of the Sentinel's crew and the origin of a mysterious signal. Watch the trailer below: What can you expect?A dark sci-fi atmosphereExploration of an abandoned spaceshipPuzzles and environmental storytellin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T20:03:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721196877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3994800-1833968530895755","game_id":"steam-3994800","kind":"announcement","title":"LORE ARCHIVE #01 — U.S.S. Sentinel Departs for the Tau Ceti","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-31T18:29:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530895755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3994800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3994800":"2026-10-26T11:21:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3994800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:5